<title>BELGIUM: EU confirms Swedish green rate to devalue on Fri.</title>
<headline>EU confirms Swedish green rate to devalue on Fri.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swedish crown's green rate will be devalued to 8.69363 to the Ecu, from 8.64446, effective on Friday, the European Commission said.</p>
<p>The UK's Home Grown Cereals Authority forecast the Swedish green rate devaluation earlier on Thursday.</p>
<p>Green rates are used by the European Union to convert Ecu farm payments into the currencies of its member states.</p>
<p>-Brussels newsroom +322 287 6830</p>
</text>
